"""Own body: build the game's Body_ mesh data from the model's own nude body (no standard body, no reshaping).

    python own_body.py <body_cfg.json>          (e.g. data/shion_body_cfg.json)

Geometry, UVs, normals and tangents are the model's (Blender corner normals + MikkTSpace tangents from
blender/export_corner_frames.py); only the T-pose of stage 2 and the stage-2 similarity removal (native size) apply.
Per vertex it adds what the game needs, all derived from the model:
  uv0/uv1  UDIM tiles packed into one atlas (slot + frac) / 2 鈥?uv1 = uv0 (non-overlapping, paint/wetness atlas)
  uv2      body-region atlas (references/13 搂2.4): cell centres painted from the model's bone weights + cavity tests
  colour   R soft-tissue (breasts/buttocks), G torso/upper-leg weight masks, B 0 (no neck graft), A 1
  weights  the model's skin weights mapped onto the game skeleton (cfg skin_map; face bones kept), top 4, UNorm16
  shapes   Vagina / Anus / Muscles from the model's own shape keys, InnerMesh computed (inward, 鈭?local radius),
           InnerMeshTexture / Penis_Skin* / Hide_Penis empty on the female body
Writes <out>/body_mesh.npz and <out>/body_report.json.
"""
